  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.27.3",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Preserve macOS machine layer mounts across peer operations by @kcosr in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1738\n* Clean up after an SDK machine delete the way the CLI does by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1746\n* Return 409 for branching a machine that was not started branchable by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1748\n* Hand a named machine's layers lease to its VMM by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1747\n* Shut a VM's guest down cleanly when its owner process exits by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1749\n* Fix guest stalls on machines booted from a pack under heavy file and mmap load by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1743\n* Bump version to 1.27.3. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1751\n\n## New Contributors\n* @kcosr made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1738\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.27.2...v1.27.3",
